  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Hei Cheng is captured and cannot move, he screams Green City Rampage. Green City Rampage was a powerful battle formation of the Olden Antiquity Era. At that time it ranked third in the world, only lower than Golden Heavenly Saint and Heavenly Giant Solor. Hei tribe’s control of Green City Rampage is known throughout Northern Plains’ Gu Immortal world, and its appearance means the four strongest supreme elders of Hei tribe have arrived together.",
      "chapters": [
        941
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_cheng",
        "evt_era_olden",
        "move_golden_heavenly_saint",
        "sys_heavenly_giant_solor",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Blazing Heaven Demoness calls the formation incomplete. She says that a hundred years earlier, using it forced the casters to stay within three meters of each other.",
      "chapters": [
        942
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "incomplete-form",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Hei Fan grotto-heaven, Gu Immortals of each generation practice Green City battle formation to kill desolate beasts and ancient desolate beasts. Fang Yuan names that Green City battle formation as only a small portion of ancient Green City Rampage.",
      "chapters": [
        1127
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-fan-green-city",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later comparison places Green City Rampage with Heavenly Giant Solor as ancient battle formations that use Gu Immortals as cores, unlike Twelve Zodiac battle formation’s year beast cores.",
      "chapters": [
        1609
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
